---
// Two-phase commit (2PC): top row shows the two "points of no return" in a normal commit;
// bottom row shows the blocking in-doubt window when the coordinator crashes after Phase 1.
// Plain inline SVG using site tokens; polygon arrowheads (no duplicate ids).

const W = 900;
const H = 472;

function arrowRight(x1: number, x2: number, y: number) {
  return { line: `M${x1},${y} L${x2 - 7},${y}`, head: `${x2 - 8},${y - 4.5} ${x2 - 8},${y + 4.5} ${x2},${y}` };
}

const cols = [
  { x: 20, w: 190 },
  { x: 238, w: 205 },
  { x: 471, w: 190 },
  { x: 689, w: 191 },
];

const topY = 104;
const botY = 324;
const boxH = 114;

const topArrows = cols.slice(1).map((c, i) => arrowRight(cols[i].x + cols[i].w + 2, c.x - 2, topY + boxH / 2));
const botArrows = cols.slice(1).map((c, i) => arrowRight(cols[i].x + cols[i].w + 2, c.x - 2, botY + boxH / 2));
---
<figure class="tx2">
  <div class="tx2-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two-phase commit flow comparing normal completion against a coordinator crash. In normal execution, shards vote Yes in phase 1, the coordinator writes COMMIT to disk, and phase 2 completes. If the coordinator crashes after phase 1 and after notifying Shard B, Shard A is stuck in doubt and must hold row locks until the coordinator recovers.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="tx2-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Two-phase commit: two promises and one blocking trap</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Two-phase commit: hai lời hứa và một bẫy treo lock</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="48" class="tx2-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Shards surrender the right to abort in phase 1; the coordinator makes the final choice durable before phase 2.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Các shard từ bỏ quyền tự abort ở pha 1; điều phối viên ghi quyết định xuống đĩa rồi mới sang pha 2.</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Top section: normal commit */}
    <text x="20" y="88" class="tx2-sec">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Normal commit (two points of no return)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Commit bình thường (hai điểm không thể quay đầu)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[0].x} y={topY} width={cols[0].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="tx2-box" />
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={topY + 24} class="tx2-in-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Prepare</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Prepare</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={topY + 49} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Coordinator asks</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Điều phối viên hỏi</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={topY + 69} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>all shards: ready?</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>mọi shard: sẵn sàng?</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={topY + 97} class="tx2-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>can still abort</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>vẫn abort được</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[1].x} y={topY} width={cols[1].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="tx2-box" />
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={topY + 24} class="tx2-in-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Vote Yes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Trả lời Yes</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={topY + 49} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Shards flush WAL &amp;</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Shard ghi WAL và</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={topY + 69} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>keep row locks held</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>giữ chặt lock dòng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={topY + 97} class="tx2-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>promise 1: no abort</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>hứa 1: không tự huỷ</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[2].x} y={topY} width={cols[2].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="tx2-box" />
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={topY + 24} class="tx2-in-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3. Commit point</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Điểm commit</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={topY + 49} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Coordinator writes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Điều phối viên ghi</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={topY + 69} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>COMMIT to disk log</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>COMMIT ra log đĩa</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={topY + 97} class="tx2-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>promise 2: irrevocable</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>hứa 2: chốt vĩnh viễn</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[3].x} y={topY} width={cols[3].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="tx2-box" />
    <text x={cols[3].x + 12} y={topY + 24} class="tx2-in-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>4. Phase 2: Commit</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>4. Pha 2: Commit</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[3].x + 12} y={topY + 49} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Retries until acked;</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Gửi lại tới khi xong;</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[3].x + 12} y={topY + 69} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>shards release locks</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>các shard nhả lock</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[3].x + 12} y={topY + 97} class="tx2-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>all shards agree</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>mọi shard đồng bộ</tspan>
    </text>

    {topArrows.map((a) => (
      <g><path d={a.line} class="tx2-arrow" /><polygon points={a.head} class="tx2-head" /></g>
    ))}

    {/* Divider */}
    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="266" y2="266" class="tx2-rule" />

    {/* Bottom section: coordinator crash */}
    <text x="20" y="304" class="tx2-sec is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Coordinator crashes after Phase 1 (blocking window)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Điều phối viên sập sau Pha 1 (cửa sổ treo lock)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[0].x} y={botY} width={cols[0].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="tx2-box" />
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={botY + 24} class="tx2-in-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Prepare</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Prepare</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={botY + 49} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Coordinator asks</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Điều phối viên hỏi</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={botY + 69} class="tx2-in-m">Shard A &amp; Shard B</text>
    <text x={cols[0].x + 12} y={botY + 97} class="tx2-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>both ready</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>cả hai sẵn sàng</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[1].x} y={botY} width={cols[1].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="tx2-box" />
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={botY + 24} class="tx2-in-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Both vote Yes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Cả hai đáp Yes</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={botY + 49} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Shard A &amp; B lock rows</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>A &amp; B đều khoá dòng</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={botY + 69} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>and promise to obey</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>và chờ lệnh cuối</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[1].x + 12} y={botY + 97} class="tx2-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>survives shard reboot</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lock giữ qua reboot</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[2].x} y={botY} width={cols[2].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="tx2-box is-bad" />
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={botY + 24} class="tx2-in-b is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3. Crash mid-Phase 2</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Sập giữa Pha 2</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={botY + 49} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Shard B gets Commit;</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Shard B nhận Commit;</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={botY + 69} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>coordinator crashes!</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>điều phối viên sập!</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[2].x + 12} y={botY + 97} class="tx2-note is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Shard A hears nothing</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Shard A bặt vô âm tín</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x={cols[3].x} y={botY} width={cols[3].w} height={boxH} rx="4" class="tx2-box is-bad" />
    <text x={cols[3].x + 12} y={botY + 24} class="tx2-in-b is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>4. Stuck in doubt</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>4. Kẹt ở in doubt</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[3].x + 12} y={botY + 49} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Shard A cannot abort</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>A không dám tự huỷ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[3].x + 12} y={botY + 69} class="tx2-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>(B already committed)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>(vì B đã commit rồi)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={cols[3].x + 12} y={botY + 97} class="tx2-note is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>locks held until recovery</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>ôm lock chờ hồi phục</tspan>
    </text>

    {botArrows.map((a) => (
      <g><path d={a.line} class="tx2-arrow" /><polygon points={a.head} class="tx2-head" /></g>
    ))}
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Why two-phase commit is a blocking protocol. Once a participant votes Yes in Phase 1, it holds its transaction locks until the coordinator recovers or an operator makes a manual heuristic decision. Distributed databases like Spanner and CockroachDB replicate the coordinator via Paxos or Raft so recovery is automatic.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Vì sao two-phase commit là giao thức có thể bị treo (blocking). Một khi nút tham gia đã đáp Yes ở Pha 1, nó phải ôm lock cho tới khi điều phối viên sống lại hoặc có người can thiệp thủ công. Các database phân tán như Spanner và CockroachDB nhân bản điều phối viên qua Paxos hay Raft để tự chuyển dự phòng.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .tx2 {
    margin: 2em 0;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .tx2-scroll {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  .tx2 svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 640px;
    height: auto;
  }
  .tx2 text {
    font-size: 14px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
  }
  .tx2 .tx2-h {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .tx2 .tx2-sub {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .tx2 .tx2-sec {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .tx2 .tx2-sec.is-bad {
    fill: var(--red);
  }
  .tx2-rule {
    stroke: var(--border);
  }
  .tx2-box {
    fill: var(--bg-alt);
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }
  .tx2-box.is-bad {
    fill: var(--red-tint-bg);
    stroke: var(--red);
    stroke-width: 1.6;
  }
  .tx2 .tx2-in-b {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--text);
  }
  .tx2 .tx2-in-b.is-bad {
    fill: var(--red);
  }
  .tx2 .tx2-in-m {
    font-size: 13px;
    fill: var(--text-body);
  }
  .tx2 .tx2-note {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .tx2 .tx2-note.is-bad {
    fill: var(--red);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .tx2-arrow {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--text-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.4;
  }
  .tx2-head {
    fill: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .tx2 figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
